              <p class="body">Step into the season feeling lifted, refined, and ready for every celebration. Visible changes in as little as 2 weeks so you can glow with confidence from every angle. <span class="bar" style="--w:11ch" role="img" aria-label="Program name withheld"></span> is available for a limited time only. Book your slot today.</p>
